{"ID":"20240511110515-h7zl46r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110515-h7zl46r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110515-h7zl46r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511123419-i2g24yb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511134002-bl1842n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513130410-t2bft4w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:52,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:52\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-095号（拖里化毒饮.淋巴脓块,乳房脓块恶臭,阴道脓疡恶臭等症候）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513130410"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511123419-i2g24yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-i2g24yb","updated":"20240511123419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此药是针对淋巴腺等内分泌系统产生脓疡而设计的处方 , 也对乳癌化脓有很好的效果 , 尤其对体内化脓後产生的恶臭有独到的效果 , 有些女性因为阴道有恶臭自己不知 , 因为已经习以为常 , 但是先生却因此而无法与之行房 , 此药效果最好 , 由於它的目的是"}]},{"ID":"20240511123419-wbja48g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-wbja48g","updated":"20240511123419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从体内攻及排出毒素及脓疡 , 故名\"拖里化毒饮\" ."}]},{"ID":"20240511123419-5a5dhtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-5a5dhtq","updated":"20240511123457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般而言如果体内有脓疡 , 大多会生异味出现 , 如鼠蹊部 , 喉咙 , 腋下 , 阴部等位 , 手部的脉动会很快数 , 面色会红赤些 , 情绪较烦躁 , 睡觉时也会觉得身体燥热 , 有时会便秘有时会下利 . 口乾但是不想喝水 , 唇口乾裂等伴随而来的症状 , 又有时块状的囊肿会很痛 , 触摸皮肤表面时会有烫手的感觉 , 皆是内部已经化脓的现象 , 此时皆可以服用此药来协助排除毒素 , 当毒素排尽时必然通"}]},{"ID":"20240511123419-5z1a3ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-5z1a3ih","updated":"20240511123419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体舒畅 , 面冷足热 , 大小便都会正常了 , 睡眠也会安稳了 , 恶臭也会同时去除 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511123419-tado0gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-tado0gx","updated":"20240511123424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方内容 : 黄耆 .....等 . 纯中药制剂 , 无任何化学添加物 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511123419-q5ifa9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123419-q5ifa9h","updated":"20240511123454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服法 :  每次30粒 , 早晚饭前各一次 . 任何人皆可使用 , 无须医师处方."}]},{"ID":"20240511134000-p9kpz54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134000-p9kpz54"}},{"ID":"20240513130410-t2bft4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513130410-t2bft4w","updated":"20240513130410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拖裡化毒飲(淋巴膿塊 、乳房膿塊惡臭、陰道膿瘍惡臭、痔瘡腫大無法坐等症候)，類似於仙豐製作的托化95號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511134001-0imvfg3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511134001-0imvfg3"}},{"ID":"20240511134002-rr7rft1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-rr7rft1","updated":"20240511134004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-95　拖里化毒饮(淋巴脓块,乳房脓块恶臭,阴道脓疡恶臭等症候)"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-15lniah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-15lniah","updated":"20240511134002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.11 B  录校：徐荣霞）"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-bv12gdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-bv12gdn","updated":"20240511134002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拖里，拖毒的，不论是手术后伤口不收，痈疽出毒伤口不收或身体破烂之后出现漏斗形成漏症不收口的，皆可从里面拖毒让它收口。"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-s32fsv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-s32fsv3","updated":"20240511160708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此药是针对淋巴腺等内分泌系统产生脓疡而设计的处方，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-u9hrnc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-u9hrnc0","updated":"20240511134002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们看到张锡纯在《衷中参西录》里面由别人给他介绍的一个方子，就是吃松香对这个长期的瘘管有效，松香也是禁服药，关键是如何炮制，炮制之后就可以吃这味药，不炮制的时候千万不要乱吃，炮制松香在水里面煮，加豆腐一块煮，与炮硫磺很相似，当中还有一点差别，"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-wosvlgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-wosvlgl","updated":"20240511160711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"也对乳癌化脓有很好的效果，尤其对体内化脓后产生的恶臭有独到的效果，有些女性因为阴道有恶臭自己不知，因为已经习以为常，但是先生却因此而无法与之行房，此药效果最好，由于它的目的是从体内攻及排出毒素及脓疡，故名\u0026quot;拖里化毒饮\u0026quot;。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-z48a7fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-z48a7fk","updated":"20240511160816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般而言如果体内有脓疡，大多会生异味出现，如鼠蹊部"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（在这个腹股沟这个部位），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喉咙，腋下，阴部等位，手部的脉动会很快数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（因为里面有毒气，称为是极数之脉），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面色会红赤些，情绪较烦躁，睡觉时也会觉得身体燥热，有时会便秘有时会下利。口干但是不想喝水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（提示体内还有水饮），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"唇口干裂等伴随而来的症状"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这相当于精液不能正常输布了，原因是体内不流通结合前面脉跳急数面红赤情绪烦躁等就说明体内就化毒了"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-e5rbjys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-e5rbjys","updated":"20240511160823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"又有时块状的囊肿会很痛，触摸皮肤表面时会有烫手的感觉（已经成痼了），皆是内部已经化脓的现象，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-87fmw48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-87fmw48","updated":"20240511134002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医外科在伤科里面有很多是治这痈疽之症的，讲的很清楚。"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-f5ixh3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-f5ixh3r","updated":"20240511160830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此时皆可以服用此药来协助排除毒素，当毒素排尽时必然通体舒畅，面冷足热，大小便都会正常了，睡眠也会安稳了，恶臭也会同时去除"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是属于里面的介绍"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-xwzxikj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-xwzxikj","updated":"20240511160834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方内容:黄耆。。。。。等。纯中药制剂，无任何化学添加物。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511134002-bl1842n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511134002-bl1842n","updated":"20240511134002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个里面主要用的药物主要是拖毒的，肯定要用到黄芪，同时要注意里面已经化脓者就是说里面已经产生很大的热在体内，要注意在拖毒的同时要去清其毒，清其毒用到什幺？二花，金银花，升麻，这之类的都不可少，因为这是阳毒，清热药是不可少的，去清毒的这一个药，要向外去拖毒，就要用生提之药，包括有排脓软坚扩脓的药都要用，用起来效果都是很好的。"}]}]}